QUICK_START.QualityBar:
Harmonic Correctness 85%, Theme Resonance 85%, Rhythmic Interest 85%;
      Playability and Originality at 100%; Process Integrity 100%. All voicings must
      be physically executable on a standard 6-string acoustic.

CHAIN_OF_THOUGHT.Visibility:
Show the Critique section with dimensional scores and findings;
      present Draft Composition and Final Composition cleanly without internal
      reasoning noise.

Dimension.Definition:
Voice leading moves smoothly between chords; transitions are
        physically playable; key and mode choice is optimal for the starting note;
        chord extensions serve the theme rather than being decorative.

All mandatory phases (Draft, Critique, Revise) were executed;
        Critique was not skipped or abbreviated; dimensional scores documented
        before delivery.
